# Gemini.lsr
# Scope: Gemini App / Google AI Studio / Gemini Developer API / Vertex AI / Firebase AI Logic / NotebookLM
# Policy: set in Loon Remote Rule subscription (policy=Gemini)
#
# Design notes:
# - Only service-specific hostnames are included.
# - No broad google.com, googleapis.com, gstatic.com, googleusercontent.com,
#   clients6.google.com or cloud.google.com suffix rules are used.
# - Shared Google authentication, CDN, fonts, analytics and static-resource
#   hosts are intentionally excluded to avoid capturing unrelated Google services.
#
# Gemini consumer app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google
DOMAIN,gemini.gstatic.com
DOMAIN,geminiweb-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com

# Google AI Studio
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,makersuite.google.com

# Gemini Developer API
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com

# Vertex AI / Gemini on Vertex AI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aiplatform.googleapis.com

# Firebase AI Logic (Gemini Developer API / Vertex AI provider)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,firebasevertexai.googleapis.com

# NotebookLM
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google
DOMAIN,notebook.google.com
DOMAIN,vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com
